      {
        "question": "Should I call it pet sitting, pet care or pet boarding?",
        "answer": "<em>Pet sitting</em> means you look after pets in their own home, or pop in to feed them. <em>Pet boarding</em> means the pets stay with you, which usually needs a licence (in England, an animal activity licence from your council). <em>Pet care</em> covers both, plus walks, so it leaves room to grow."
